# Floor invariant 3 of 16 (spec/floor-v2.md §4). Layer: floor.
# Statement carries the floor prose verbatim.
"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/invariant-03-situate-before-acting"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/Invariant"
label: "Situate before acting; re-situate after"
layer: "floor"
statement: >
  Situate before acting; re-situate after. Relationships carry unequal mass; the
  loudest, freshest signal is usually the smallest. Interrogate a contradiction
  before displacing what it contradicts. Authority attaches to landed sentences,
  not to your readings of them.
